  julia :  REFUSED: `biv_student()` currently allows fixed-effect `mu1`/`mu2` only, with intercept-only `sigma1`, `sigma2`, shared `nu`, and `rho12`. ✖ Non-intercept formula on "sigma1". ℹ Random or structured effects, `meta_V()`, offsets, and sigma/nu/rho   predictors are deferred on `engine = "julia"` exactly as they are on `engine   = "tmb"`. 

